note fsout.om: an out parameter written before a trap. Freestanding ABI v2 copies the out buffer back
note only on status 0, so after the trap the caller's buffer must hold what it held before the call.
om2
export fn fsout x ulong o out uchar 16 to ulong
put o 0 7
if eq x 0
trap 5
end
ret add x 1
end
